*Heading
** Isotropic-diffusion control: white-matter diffusivity is 160 in all three directions.
** Gray-matter diffusivity remains 16; only white-matter directionality differs from the anisotropic case.
*Parameter
** Diffusion parameters
K22 = 160
K11 = 0.1*K22
K33 = 0.1*K22
Kw = 160
** Mechanical properties
Gshear_white  = 1.15e3
Kbulk_white   = 56.35e3
Gshear_gray   = 2.07e3
Kbulk_gray    = 101.43e3
MatType_gray  = 0
MatType_white = 1
** MatType: 0 = isotropic, 1 = orthotropic
** Protein-induced atrophy parameters
G_0                    = -0.01
Atrophy_rate_white     = -0.03
Atrophy_rate_gray      = 1.5*Atrophy_rate_white
Critical_concentration = 0.5
Molar_volume = 0.0
